WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
You can lose twelve minutes checking
whether you have twelve minutes.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
A quiet routine may be worth trying.
But time isn't proof of a brainwave change.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Zen12 sells guided and sound-only recordings
in six- or twelve-level packages.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Beginner and Advanced have six levels.
Premium has all twelve.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Try twelve minutes free. Read the evidence.
Then decide what is worth buying.
